---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Ascend Program"
  description="Long-term, large-scale project work to accelerate your career. Transform from capable developer to respected senior engineer."
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-zinc-50 py-28 lg:py-40 overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10">
      <img src="/images/gen/packages/ascend.png" alt="" class="w-full h-full object-cover" />
    </div>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-zinc-50 via-zinc-50/95 to-zinc-50/80"></div>

    <div class="relative max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="font-mono text-indigo-600 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">Career Acceleration Program</p>
      <h1 class="font-display text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-6">Ascend</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-zinc-600 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        Long-term, large-scale project work to accelerate your career.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="animate-on-scroll">
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-8">Pioneering Effective Tech Career Development</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6 text-zinc-600 text-lg leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            In the landscape of software development learning, there are conventional paths, and then there's <strong class="text-zinc-900">Ascend</strong>. We've carved out a unique niche for developers seeking to transform into tech innovators and leaders, without conforming to the traditional boundaries of tech education.
          </p>
          <p>
            Here, learning is not confined to videos, or textbooks, or lectures. It's about getting your hands dirty in the soil of real-world tech problems. It's about those lightbulb moments when a complex problem suddenly makes sense, about the camaraderie of solving tough challenges with your peers, and about the satisfaction of seeing your ideas come to life.
          </p>
          <p>
            When you enter the program, you will join a carefully selected team of 3 or 4 curious and motivated peers, alongside an experienced veteran as a mentor, to work on system challenges to expand your capabilities with every session.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- What makes it stand apart -->
      <div class="mt-16 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 animate-on-scroll">
        <div class="bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-3">Real-World Application</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Step beyond the typical training experience into a realm of hands-on, practical learning.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-3">Dynamic Skill Evolution</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your growth is driven by actual project work, not a static curriculum.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl p-6">
          <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-indigo-600 mb-3">Developer to Innovator</h3>
          <p class="text-zinc-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">Shaping you into a forward-thinking innovator, ready to lead with confidence.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Three Tiers -->
  <section class="bg-zinc-50 py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-zinc-900 text-center mb-4 animate-on-scroll">Three Tiers of Growth</h2>
      <p class="text-zinc-500 text-center mb-16 max-w-2xl mx-auto animate-on-scroll">Each tier builds on the last, deepening and broadening your competencies.</p>

      <div class="space-y-8 animate-on-scroll">
        <!-- Tier 1 -->
        <div class="relative bg-white border border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="hidden sm:flex flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-400 rounded-2xl items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600">1</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
                <span class="sm:hidden font-mono text-indigo-600 text-sm mr-2">TIER 1</span>
                Ignite
              </h3>
              <p class="text-indigo-600 text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Foundation • ~6-8 months</p>
              <p class="text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Build the foundational competencies and understanding of automation, the Linux operating system, caching strategies, virtual machines, and some basic cloud services. These concepts are the bedrock of modern tools and processes.
              </p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Automation</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Linux</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Caching</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">VMs</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Basic Cloud</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Connector -->
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-px h-8 bg-indigo-300"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 2 -->
        <div class="relative bg-white border border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="hidden sm:flex flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-400 rounded-2xl items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600">2</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
                <span class="sm:hidden font-mono text-indigo-600 text-sm mr-2">TIER 2</span>
                Rise
              </h3>
              <p class="text-indigo-600 text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Deepening • ~6-8 months</p>
              <p class="text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Continue to both broaden and deepen your competencies. Learn the pieces of a mature CI/CD process, deepen software fundamentals, explore infrastructure as code, and grow your ability to make smart, reliable technology decisions.
              </p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Full CI/CD</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Software Fundamentals</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">IaC</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Tech Decisions</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Connector -->
        <div class="flex justify-center">
          <div class="w-px h-8 bg-indigo-300"></div>
        </div>

        <!-- Tier 3 -->
        <div class="relative bg-white border border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-sm">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-6">
            <div class="hidden sm:flex flex-shrink-0 w-16 h-16 bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-400 rounded-2xl items-center justify-center">
              <span class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-indigo-600">3</span>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">
                <span class="sm:hidden font-mono text-indigo-600 text-sm mr-2">TIER 3</span>
                Zenith
              </h3>
              <p class="text-indigo-600 text-sm font-mono uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">Mastery • ~6-8 months</p>
              <p class="text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Begin the journey of learning the thought processes, behaviors, technical prowess and business alignment that the highest value, most senior technologists bring to an organization. Explore sophisticated telemetry, modern cloud architecture, and frictionless CI/CD.
              </p>
              <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Advanced Telemetry</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Modern Cloud Architecture</span>
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-mono bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-600 rounded-full">Frictionless CI/CD</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Structure -->
  <section class="bg-white py-24 lg:py-32">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 animate-on-scroll">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-6">Structure & Commitment</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-zinc-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Ascend cohorts are comprised of either 3 or 4 technologists and your cohort's mentor. This is a very limited and intimate engagement that requires total commitment from each member.</p>
            <p>Each cohort will decide on the days and times of the sessions, and their frequency. One cohort may meet two nights per week for 1-hour sessions. Another may want to meet for 3 hours every Saturday.</p>
            <p>Each cohort is designed to complete one tier of the program. Once a tier is complete, it is up to the cohort to continue together if everyone wants to take on the next tier.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Pricing Card -->
        <div>
          <div class="bg-indigo-50 border-2 border-indigo-200 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center">
            <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-zinc-900 mb-2">Investment Per Tier</h3>
            <div class="font-display text-5xl font-bold text-indigo-600 my-6">$3,000</div>
            <div class="space-y-3 text-zinc-600 text-sm mb-8">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-2 border-b border-indigo-200/50">
                <span>25% on acceptance</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-indigo-600">$750</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-2 border-b border-indigo-200/50">
                <span>6 monthly payments</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-indigo-600">$375/mo</span>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between py-2">
                <span>Duration per tier</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-indigo-600">~6-8 months</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <a
              href="https://calendly.com/stevebrownlee/ascend-program-overview"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block w-full px-8 py-4 bg-indigo-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-xl hover:bg-indigo-700 transition-colors duration-200 text-center"
            >
              <Icon name="calendar-check" class="w-5 h-5 inline-block mr-1 -mt-0.5" /> Schedule a time to chat with Steve
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
